WEBVTT

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.960
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.310
...crazy about you!

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.660
Get bent, you dirty old man!

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:57.930
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:05.540
Dark-skinned with large eyes
and red hair distressed by chlorine...

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:09.210
''Hard-nosed.'' ''Sassy.'' ''Plaything.''

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:11.510
l'm always at a disadvantage
because of my looks.

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:17.480
"'Love Hurricane!"'

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:24.510
For {ete's sake, if that's not
what you call relentless!

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:27.750
Still, I can understand
why those old guys talk you up.

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.720
Momo-chan, you do look
like the sort who fools around.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:34.420
Huh? Sae, your bag...

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.430
Oh, this? I went and bought it.

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:39.920
You bought it? But that's...

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:43.100
l had my eye on it yesterday.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.770
But l didn't have enough money on hand,
so l was going to buy it today...

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:51.110
I bought it after you left, Momo-chan.
I wound up wanting it, too.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:54.440
Sae, do you even like that style?

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.110
Mm-hmm, I guess so.

00:02:56.110 --> 00:03:00.720
You liar! Who was it that
dumped on whose tastes yesterday!?

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:05.720
You knew l wanted it, and now you aren't
even offering the slightest apology!

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:08.720
Ah! Kashiwagi-san, is that a new bag?

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:10.060
It's so cute!

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:11.730
Oh yeah?

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:13.800
Sae copies everything.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:16.460
"'Today's fashion check"'

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:20.160
Matching loafers, matching socks,
matching nails, matching lips...

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:24.410
And l hate to admit it, but it all
looks better on her than it does on me.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.140
Her petite, slender build
and fair complexion

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.130
make her way popular with the boys.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:30.750
Good morning, Sae-chan.

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.750
Good morning.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:37.090
l've known her for three months now.
Lately, she's been fairly annoying.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:40.420
Tojigamori-kun, good morning!

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:44.430
'Sup, Adachi? I saw Tetsuya
and Machako yesterday.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:48.100
No way, really? I miss them!
Are they doing okay?

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:50.770
Mm-hmm. This is from Machako.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:53.030
It's a print club photo
the three of us took yesterday.

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:57.110
She said to say hi to Adachi for her.

00:03:57.110 --> 00:03:58.800
Thanks, Toji!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.380
All right!

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.970
l got a purikura photo of Toji!

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:13.210
Momo-chan, you talk to
Tojigamori-kun a lot, huh?

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.730
And yet you don't talk to
any of the other boys that much.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:21.730
Uh, yeah. We were in the same class
in middle school for two years.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:24.400
I- I'm going to go change my water!

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.740
That was close, that was close...

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:29.740
Kashiwagi Sae has got
to be number one, though.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.740
She is cute, huh?

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:34.410
She's got that nice fair skin.

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:38.080
Wha-?

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.750
Why is Adachi so dark, anyhow?

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.750
I wonder if she goes to a tanning salon.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:44.750
You morons.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:48.420
Adachi used to be on the swim team.
That's why she's so tan.

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:52.050
Don't go spouting nonsense when you
don't know what you're talking about.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.450
Toji...

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:02.040
If you keep applying that all the time,
your skin won't be able to breathe, will it?

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:03.170
That's okay.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:06.780
I'm not about to tan this summer,
and I will get back to my regular skin color.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.640
"'Hand in your classic lit notes..."'

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:14.380
Then, when l'm lighter than Toji,

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.370
l'll declare my love to him.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:24.390
Momo-chan, is there anyone you like?

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:25.730
There is, isn't there?

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.730
Y- yikes!

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:29.730
Can I try guessing who? To-

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:33.740
O- oh, no! How could you tell?

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:36.400
I was too embarrassed,
so I've kept it a secret all this time.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:39.070
That's right! I...

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:41.440
...like that guy!

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:52.910
Thank goodness there happened to be
a popular first-year guy over there.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:02.460
What?

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:08.370
T- that was startling! l've never
been winked at by a boy before.

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:13.370
Okayasu Kairi... l've never taken
a good look at him before now,

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.080
but he does indeed
have the face of a model.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.710
That's why the girls
are making a fuss over him.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:19.870
But Toji is a hundred times better looking.

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:31.320
S- Sae!

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:37.060
Okayasu-kun!

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:43.070
Huh? That bag...

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:45.410
This? Isn't it cute?

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:47.410
Why do you have it, Sae-chan?

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:50.570
I seem to remember you calling it
a piece of junk, didn't you, Sae-chan?

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:57.540
I happened to see you.
Wasn't it your friend that wanted it?

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:02.690
W- what are you getting at? It's not
like I took it out from under her!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:06.030
I prefer girls who are considerate.

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:09.030
And as long as I'm saying so, Sae-chan,
rather than sickly-looking girls like you,

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:12.030
I prefer healthy-looking girls,
like your friend.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:15.430
You're going to lose all your friends
if you act so self-centered.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:21.040
You can have this tacky bag!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.440
Sae?

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.380
What's got her so unruly?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.380
Beats me.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.350
I heard she got turned down by Kairi.

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:34.180
Sae got... Sae got turned down?

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:41.360
Bravo, Okayasu! Suddenly, l like you!
Though you're still a far cry from Toji.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:47.470
Good morning!

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:53.270
"'Adachi Momo"' "'Okayasu Kairi"'

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.350
Why did you do that!?

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.690
Do what?

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:06.020
Sae, you're the one who drew
that umbrella, aren't you?

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:07.020
What do you mean?

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:12.030
Don't act dumb! Sae, you're the
only one who knows I like Okayasu!

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:15.030
How could you start a rumor about me!?

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:18.370
What's the big deal?
It's the truth, after all.

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:23.040
Though I should tell you, it wasn't me.
Someone must have overheard us talking.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:25.940
Don't go doubting others
without asking first.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:32.150
Now I'm mad! If you didn't do it,
then who else would!?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.390
She didn't want the rumor to get
around that she had been turned down,

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:41.120
so she makes me her scapegoat!
Who does she think l am!?

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:50.730
How did you trick Kairi into liking you?

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:53.400
You're the one who came on to him, right?

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:58.740
Hold on. You've got it all wrong. I've never
even talked all that much to Okayasu-kun.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:01.210
Don't play innocent, you've kissed him.

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:09.020
Kissed him!? Who said that!?

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.350
Don't tell me it was Sae again!

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:12.510
Kairi did.

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:16.690
You've got to be kidding me.
I don't have time for this.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:17.360
Where are you going!?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:18.690
To find Okayasu!

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:19.360
Hold it!

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:20.880
We're not letting you go anywhere!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:38.640
Keep your hands off of Kairi.

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.110
Move it.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.390
I said move your foot!

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:50.390
How dare you... how dare you
trample on my Toji!

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.950
You'll pay for that! Are you
ever going to pay for that!

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:03.070
Way to go! Fight! Fight!

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:04.740
--Kairi!
--Help!

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:07.410
Whoa, I'm not helping you out.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.310
You guys settle this by yourselves.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:18.140
Huh? What's the matter?
You're not going to fight anymore?

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:22.090
Whose fault do you think this is!?

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:30.770
Kairi!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:35.770
Yow! That hurt! That's a hell of a punch
you've got there, Momo-chan.

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:39.110
Who did you say kissed you
where and when? Huh?

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:41.440
Oh dear, don't you remember?

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:42.940
It was two years ago.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:46.450
Momo-chan, you saved a boy
who was drowning in the ocean, right?

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:48.110
Two years ago?

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.790
Remember now?

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:58.330
You mean that idiot who couldn't swim,

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:00.130
but tried to show off
by holding onto a beach ball...

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.730
...and wading out to sea, but then got
a cramp in his leg and nearly drowned?

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:05.400
Yeah... right...

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:09.070
When I wasn't breathing, you performed
artificial respiration on me.

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:11.070
I didn't do it.

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:13.670
Not this again. I remember what happened-

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:16.740
the feeling of your long hair
hanging down into my face.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:18.250
What are you talking about?

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:21.840
It was that lifeguard guy that
performed artificial respiration on you.

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:30.430
Oh.

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:32.090
We were worried over nothing.

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:34.430
Let's go, let's go.

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:38.430
You're kidding... that long hair...
that long hair... was a guy?

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:41.100
You're going to take
responsibility for this, right?

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.360
Responsibility?

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:46.110
This disaster is all your fault.

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:47.840
You're the reason that
crazy rumor got spread around-

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:53.740
You didn't tell anyone else
that you and I kissed, did you!?

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:57.790
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!
What did you do that for!?

00:11:57.790 --> 00:12:01.720
I'm sure it's spread everywhere by now!
And I didn't even kiss you!

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:04.390
lf Toji hears about it!

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:06.760
Look, isn't there
anything you can do about it?

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:09.230
Some way to keep any more people
from being misled?

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.730
Yes, there is.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.070
Really?

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:15.330
We can just make the rumor the truth.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:51.640
Should we start going out now?

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:53.970
If we're going out, the rumor
will be put to rest, right?

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.110
Momo-chan?

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:03.520
Was it that good?
All right then, once more...

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:07.080
What are you doing!?

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:14.060
I wish I hadn't saved you back then!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.730
You idiot! You sex fiend! You pumpkin!

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.790
P- pumpkin?

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:25.200
What's with him!? What's with him!?
He's awful! Unbelievable! Out of nowhere!

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:32.980
No... lt wasn't a kiss!
That was no kiss!

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:46.390
Wow, the gossip is incredible!
Listen, you didn't really kiss, did you?

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:49.790
Say something, Momo-chan.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.080
Whoa! That was blunt!

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:05.380
Did Tojigamori-kun just completely
give you the cold shoulder?

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:08.280
Toji knows.

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:13.450
Well sure he would, the way
the rumors have been flying around.

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:15.390
Of course he'd know.

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:18.290
After kissing a guy
l'm not even going out with,

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:22.160
l've been... l've been... scorned...

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.800
Why did it have to turn out like this?

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:30.070
Toji is the only one l've had
feelings for, ever since middle school.

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:34.680
l chose to come to this school because
Toji said he was going to go here.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:35.900
And now...

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:45.450
Mm, these broad shoulders are promising.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:50.420
Don't touch me as
if we're close, you pumpkin!

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:53.090
That's not very nice,
after we've kissed and everything.

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:54.760
Don't say that!

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:57.430
You've got some nerve
showing your face around me!

00:14:57.430 --> 00:15:00.100
Why are you sitting out today?
That time of the month?

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:04.040
That's not it! I don't want
to get any more suntanned!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.370
Why not? It looks so healthy!

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:09.710
I wonder if those two really
are seeing each other.

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:12.050
They couldn't be.
He's just being goofy as usual.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:15.240
Kairi said he'd never get
serious with anyone, right?

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:22.520
We need to talk. Come with me a minute.

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:28.060
Are the stories true?
Did you kiss Adachi?

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:31.400
Um... what is your
relationship with Momo-chan?

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:34.070
I don't need to answer you.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.160
In that case, I'm not telling, either!

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:45.410
If you're just playing around with Adachi,
then stay away from her.

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:47.580
It's easy to get the wrong idea
because of how she looks,

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:50.680
but Adachi is not like those ditzy girls.

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:54.920
I get it.

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:56.090
W- what?

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:58.760
What you're saying is, it's okay
as long as I'm not playing around?

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:00.090
I'm not...

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:03.830
I'm extremely interested
in girls like Momo-chan.

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:06.700
I wouldn't mind seriously
going out with her.

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:09.370
Say, do you think Momo-chan
is just naturally dark?

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:11.170
Or did she use to be lighter?

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:17.270
Wouldn't you like to see what
she's like underneath that uniform?

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:25.210
Don't ever go near Adachi again.
If you do, I'll kick your ass.

00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:36.730
Oh, Tojigamori-kun, going home now?

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:40.360
Say, is it okay if I call you
"'Toji"' like Momo-chan does?

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:43.070
Yay! I'm so glad!

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:45.070
Cut it out already!

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:47.070
Why are you sticking on me!?

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:50.410
Well, it's because
I've come to like you, Momo-chan.

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:52.080
He's at it again!

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:59.750
The one in that purikura photo?
Um... Toji, was it?

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:05.760
That's right. I've liked him
ever since middle school.

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:08.700
So, have you declared your love for him?

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.030
I'm going to do it later.

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:13.370
How come? If you dally around,
someone else will take him.

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:15.370
I know, but...

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:17.370
But what?

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.710
A friend of mine told me...

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:25.010
You know, Momo, I heard that Toji
doesn't like girls with darker skin.

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:30.820
I was shocked.
But I just couldn't give up.

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:35.060
I thought about it, and it wasn't
as though he said he didn't like me.

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:37.060
If I just could just get rid
of this tan, then Toji would...

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:39.390
So that's why you
were skipping swimming?

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:40.390
That's right!

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:44.730
I put on sunblock every hour, and pick
shady places when I walk around outside,

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:47.070
and wear long sleeves outside
of school as much as I can.

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:50.070
Your efforts are touching.

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:53.070
You get it now? I don't
want you around me.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:56.740
No! I like you even more now that I
see how earnest you are, Momo-chan!

00:17:56.740 --> 00:18:00.350
Don't touch me, "'Bakayasu"'! Get away!

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:04.690
What's going on with Momo-chan?
I thought you were the one she liked, Toji!

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:07.310
That's awful! Momo-chan told me-

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:37.780
"'Let's discuss our future. I'll be

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:55.060
What is that idiot
standing on ceremony for now?

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:09.980
Oh well. I'm going to settle
this once and for all this time!

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:24.960
Okayasu!?

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:28.900
You moron! What are you
fooling around for!?

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:30.560
Hurry and come up out of there!

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:37.110
This is for real? That idiot!

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:50.450
Okayasu! Okayasu! Snap out of it!

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:55.230
He's not breathing! He needs help!

00:19:56.730 --> 00:20:01.740
A person's brain will become damaged in
four minutes if it doesn't get any oxygen.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:05.430
So you have to perform artificial
respiration as soon as possible.

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:15.750
It's true. There's definitely something
fishy going on between those two.

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.180
See? There they are!

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:27.760
No way! Unbelievable! That's going too far!

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:33.100
I can't bear to watch!

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:35.100
Hold on. Something's wrong.

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:37.770
Adachi! What's wrong!?

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:38.770
Toji!

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:41.970
Call an ambulance!
Okayasu is... Okayasu is...

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:44.970
Okayasu?

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:48.380
"'Nurse's Office"'

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:52.790
He's all right now.
Nice call there, Adachi-san.

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:56.460
You can let me take it from here,
and go on home now.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:57.460
Okay.

00:20:57.460 --> 00:21:00.330
Thank you, Momo-chan! I love you!

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.730
You just lie there quietly!

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:07.400
Misao-chan, is that
any way to treat a patient?

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:12.070
To slip and fall into the pool
just proves that you're capricious.

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:14.740
Thank goodness you cooled your head off.

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:17.730
Bye, Momo-chan! See you tomorrow!

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.750
I'm glad he's okay.

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:26.120
Mm-hmm, I'm really glad too.

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:30.720
I mean- after all,
if he had died or anything,

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.490
I wouldn't be able to sleep at night!

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:40.000
That's right. Toji saw me giving
artificial respiration to him.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.770
What do l do now?

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:43.170
I'm sorry...

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:50.110
I overheard what you and he were
talking about yesterday, Adachi.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:51.870
Yesterday...

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:55.840
l've liked him ever since middle school.

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:59.790
T- Toji heard that?

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:03.120
I don't dislike girls with dark skin.

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:07.050
And I like you too, Adachi.

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:43.180
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:52.860
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.690
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.690 --> 00:23:02.470
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.470 --> 00:23:08.800
Where can we go

00:23:08.800 --> 00:23:18.350
where we can all be

00:23:18.350 --> 00:23:21.150
under the same sky?

00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:29.490
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.490 --> 00:23:36.170
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.170 --> 00:23:42.510
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.510 --> 00:23:49.650
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:57.610
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.990 --> 00:24:07.860
Huh? l don't believe it! l wanted to
kiss him, but why did Sae kiss him first!?

00:24:07.860 --> 00:24:09.670
Now l'm mad!

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:13.760
Next time on {each Girl, "'Trap Kiss!"'
